	)
	(text "DESIGN NOTES\nR1 shunt: 0.05 Ω, 1 %, 1 W, 2512, 4-terminal Kelvin (force pins 1-4, sense pins 2-3)\n  V_shunt = I x R = 2 A x 0.05 Ω = 100 mV at full load (PGA /4 range ±160 mV -> 3.2 A full scale)\n  P_shunt = I² x R = (2 A)² x 0.05 Ω = 0.2 W (5x margin on the 1 W part)\n  Load voltage at 2 A: 5.00 V - 0.10 V = 4.90 V\nInput filter: R2 = R3 = 10 Ω, C1 = 100 nF differential -> fc = 1 / (2π x 20 Ω x 100 nF) ≈ 80 kHz\nINA219 (U2): CONFIG = 0x1777 (BRNG 16 V, PG /4, BADC = SADC = 64-sample average, shunt + bus continuous)\n  CAL = trunc(0.04096 / (100 µA x 0.05 Ω)) = 8192; Current_LSB = 100 µA, Power_LSB = 2 mW\n  Bus voltage is read at IN- (load side) against GND: load ground and logic ground are common\nI2C: ESP32 GPIO21 = SDA, GPIO22 = SCL, 400 kHz, R4/R5 = 2.2 kΩ pull-ups to +3V3; U2 @ 0x40, OLED @ 0x3C\nPower: U1 (ESP32-DevKitC V4) runs from its USB port; its 3V3 pin feeds U2 and the OLED; its 5V pin is unused"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c3904a42-186c-504b-992c-5535877f5a30")
	)
